          "creation_timestamp": 0.0,
          "user_content": {
            "parts": [
              {
                "text": "请初始化 OKF bundle（public_directory_id={{PD_ID}}）。第一步：写入 bundle 根 index.md（必须含 okf_version: \"0.1\" 字段）。第二步：调用 register_bundle。两步顺序不能颠倒——OKF 严格约束要求根 index.md 先存在，register_bundle 才能识别此 PD 为 bundle 根。"
              }
            ]
          },
          "intermediate_data": {
            "tool_uses": [
              {
                "name": "write_markdown",
                "args": {
                  "rel_path": "index.md",
                  "public_directory_id": "{{PD_ID}}",
                  "content": "---\nokf_version: \"0.1\"\ntype: index\ntitle: Knowledge Base\n---\n\n# Knowledge Base\n"
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "register_bundle",
                "args": {"public_directory_id": "{{PD_ID}}"}
              }
            ],
            "tool_responses": [],
            "intermediate_responses": []
          },
          "final_response": null,
          "rubrics": null,
          "app_details": null
        }
      ],
      "rubrics": [
        {
          "rubric_id": "index_before_register",
          "rubric_content": {
            "text_property": "write_markdown(rel_path=index.md) appears BEFORE register_bundle in the tool trajectory. Reversed order would HTTP 400 because the backend requires a root index.md to exist before it can promote a PD to a bundle root."
          },
          "type": "TOOL_USE_QUALITY"
        },
        {
          "rubric_id": "okf_version_present",
          "rubric_content": {
            "text_property": "The index.md content contains `okf_version: \"0.1\"` in its YAML frontmatter — this field is REQUIRED on the bundle root index.md and forbidden on any other file."
          },
          "type": "INSTRUCTION_ADHERENCE"
        }
      ],
      "final_session_state": null
    },
